    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mtable><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi>Benzoic</mi><mo> </mo><mi>acid</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>Sodium</mi><mo> </mo><mi>benzoate</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>Molarity</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>Volume</mi></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi>ml</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mi>ml</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>milli</mi><mo> </mo><mi>moles</mi></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtext> salt </mtext><mo>]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtext> acid </mtext><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>Where</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mo> </mo><mi>Volume</mi><mo> </mo><mi>of</mi><mo> </mo><mi>salt</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mo> </mo><mi>Volume</mi><mo> </mo><mi>of</mi><mo> </mo><mi>acid</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>..........(i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></math>........(ii)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>ml</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
